    "name_raw": "Vast Spell",
    "definition_type_raw": "Metamagic",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Player Companion: Magic Tactics Toolbox",
    "definition_raw": "Your spells cover targets across a larger area.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Caster level 3rd.\n\nBenefit(s): You can alter a spell that targets a number of creatures no more than 30 feet apart, such as haste. The maximum distance apart of those you target with the spell increases to 60 feet.\n\nLevel Increase: +1 (a vast spell uses up a spell slot 1 level higher than the spell’s actual level.)",
